// --- Crosslink formation/dissolution calibration (benchmark-contractile-dense v4) ---
// v4 LOCKED heavy-crosslink load (percolation NOT a target — compute cost is count-driven).
// grab=0.05, maxFilLinkDist=0.02, xLinkOnRate=400, xLinkConc=1 -> ~0.5 ACTIVE links/fil at
// 10x density, a clean formation/dissolution balance. Active links peak ~500 then FALL at
// longer reach (over-stretched long links break in a step), so 1-2 active links/fil is
// geometrically unreachable here; the network bundles rather than bridges (does not percolate
// -- expected, not a gate). Held constant across the weak-scaling siblings. See
// BENCHMARK_contractile_dense.md and RUN_LOGS/2026-06-12_dense_v4/. sideBonds (=Env.xLinks) mode 0.
